{
  "name": "combobox",
  "title": "可搜索选择",
  "titleEn": "Combobox",
  "category": "form",
  "summary": "可输入关键字过滤的单选下拉（WAI-ARIA combobox + listbox），支持内联选项或增强原生 <select>；附带可复用的 riko-listbox 选项列表样式。",
  "when": "选项较多（> 7 个）需要搜索时。选项很少用 riko-select（原生下拉）或 radio / segmented；可自由输入多个值用 tags-input。",
  "root": "riko-combobox",
  "element": "div",
  "parts": [
    {
      "class": "riko-combobox__input",
      "desc": "文本输入框（role=combobox 等 ARIA 由 JS 补全）",
      "required": true
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-combobox__list",
      "desc": "弹出的选项列表 <ul>，同时加 riko-listbox",
      "required": true
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-combobox__value",
      "desc": "隐藏 input，保存选中值（写 data-riko-name 时自动生成）"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-listbox",
      "desc": "选项列表容器（可脱离 combobox 单独用于菜单式列表）"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-listbox__option",
      "desc": "选项 <li>，data-value 为提交值，文本为显示名"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-listbox__desc",
      "desc": "选项内的次要说明"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-listbox__group",
      "desc": "分组标题（role=presentation）"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-listbox__empty",
      "desc": "无结果提示（JS 自动生成）"
    }
  ],
  "modifiers": [
    {
      "class": "riko-combobox--sm",
      "desc": "小号",
      "group": "size"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-combobox--lg",
      "desc": "大号",
      "group": "size"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-combobox--block",
      "desc": "占满容器宽度",
      "group": "shape"
    }
  ],
  "states": [
    {
      "attr": "aria-expanded=\"true\"",
      "on": "riko-combobox__input",
      "desc": "列表展开（JS 维护）"
    },
    {
      "attr": "aria-selected=\"true\"",
      "on": "riko-listbox__option",
      "desc": "已选中（可在 HTML 中预设初始值）"
    },
    {
      "attr": "aria-disabled=\"true\"",
      "on": "riko-listbox__option",
      "desc": "不可选的选项"
    },
    {
      "attr": "data-state=\"active\"",
      "on": "riko-listbox__option",
      "desc": "键盘高亮项（JS 维护）"
    },
    {
      "attr": "disabled",
      "on": "riko-combobox__input",
      "desc": "禁用"
    }
  ],
  "js": {
    "attr": "data-riko=\"combobox\"",
    "options": [
      {
        "attr": "data-riko-name",
        "values": "字符串",
        "default": "",
        "desc": "内联模式下生成隐藏 input 的 name"
      },
      {
        "attr": "data-riko-empty",
        "values": "字符串",
        "default": "没有找到呢……换个关键词试试吧 ✦",
        "desc": "无结果提示文案"
      }
    ],
    "methods": [
      {
        "signature": "el.riko.value",
        "desc": "当前选中值"
      },
      {
        "signature": "el.riko.setValue(value)",
        "desc": "按 data-value 选中"
      },
      {
        "signature": "el.riko.open()",
        "desc": "打开列表"
      },
      {
        "signature": "el.riko.close()",
        "desc": "关闭列表"
      },
      {
        "signature": "el.riko.refresh()",
        "desc": "动态增删选项后重新扫描"
      }
    ],
    "events": [
      {
        "name": "riko:combobox:change",
        "detail": "{ value, label, option }",
        "desc": "选中值改变"
      },
      {
        "name": "riko:combobox:open",
        "detail": "",
        "desc": "列表打开"
      },
      {
        "name": "riko:combobox:close",
        "detail": "",
        "desc": "列表关闭"
      }
    ]
  },
  "a11y": [
    "输入框需要 aria-label 或 <label for>；增强 select 时会自动把 <label for> 转接到生成的输入框。",
    "键盘：↓ 打开 / 下移，↑ 上移，Home / End 首尾，Enter 选中，Esc 关闭（再按清空）。"
  ],
  "rules": [
    "只写结构，role / aria-* / id 全部交给 JS。",
    "内联选项用 data-value 指定提交值；显示文本取选项的第一段文字（可用 data-label 覆盖）。",
    "列表以 popover 顶层显示，放在弹窗、卡片里也不会被遮挡。"
  ],
  "avoid": [
    "不要把 riko-listbox__option 写成 <button> 或 <a>。",
    "不要给 combobox 输入框加 riko-input 类。"
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "title": "内联选项",
      "html": "<div class=\"riko-combobox\" data-riko=\"combobox\" data-riko-name=\"character\">\n  <input class=\"riko-combobox__input\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"选择一位角色…\" aria-label=\"角色\">\n  <ul class=\"riko-combobox__list riko-listbox\">\n    <li class=\"riko-listbox__option\" data-value=\"riko\">络可<span class=\"riko-listbox__desc\">沙滩上的小画家</span></li>\n    <li class=\"riko-listbox__option\" data-value=\"star\">Star<span class=\"riko-listbox__desc\">戴眼罩的少年</span></li>\n    <li class=\"riko-listbox__option\" data-value=\"111\">111<span class=\"riko-listbox__desc\">HV 的村长</span></li>\n    <li class=\"riko-listbox__option\" data-value=\"wuni\">无昵</li>\n    <li class=\"riko-listbox__option\" data-value=\"rhedar\">Rhedar</li>\n    <li class=\"riko-listbox__option\" data-value=\"mizu\" aria-disabled=\"true\">Mizu（暂未登场）</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>"
    },
    {
      "title": "增强原生下拉",
      "html": "<div class=\"riko-field\" style=\"max-width: 320px\">\n  <label class=\"riko-field__label\" for=\"act\">想从哪一幕开始读？</label>\n  <div class=\"riko-combobox riko-combobox--block\" data-riko=\"combobox\">\n    <select id=\"act\" name=\"act\">\n      <option value=\"\">搜索幕名…</option>\n      <optgroup label=\"序章\">\n        <option value=\"p1\">第一幕：沙滩上的画家</option>\n        <option value=\"p2\">第二幕：归途的微光</option>\n        <option value=\"p3\">第三幕：暗林深处</option>\n      </optgroup>\n      <optgroup label=\"第一章\">\n        <option value=\"c1\">第一幕：自晨曦中归来</option>\n        <option value=\"c2\">第二幕：于木石间相嬉</option>\n        <option value=\"c5\">第五幕：落星摇曳，清风回荡</option>\n      </optgroup>\n    </select>\n  </div>\n</div>"
    }
  ],
  "requires": [
    {
      "selector": ".riko-combobox:not(:has(select))",
      "has": ".riko-combobox__input",
      "message": "riko-combobox 需要 input.riko-combobox__input（或包裹一个 <select>）"
    },
    {
      "selector": ".riko-combobox__list",
      "has": ".riko-listbox__option",
      "message": "riko-combobox__list 内需要 li.riko-listbox__option"
    },
    {
      "selector": ".riko-listbox__option",
      "parent": ".riko-listbox",
      "message": "riko-listbox__option 必须位于 riko-listbox 内"
    }
  ],
  "related": [
    "select",
    "search",
    "tags-input",
    "dropdown"
  ]
}
